"""Zoo 1.154.0: grime at a wall's base.

`stain_base` (`dressing.grime_grid`): a grid 2 mm off a wall along a span, darkest at the ground and fading up to a
wandering top edge, in the wall's skin renamed `_stain` for Level Factory's overlay; wound to face out of the wall.

Proven: tests/test_stain_base.py fails on 1.153.0 (fails_on_old.out.txt); the clone's pure half (suite_clone.out.txt)
and Blender half (suite_bpy_clone.out.txt); the slice rebuilt four times (the factory's docs/findings/slice_look/,
slices 18-20).
"""
